{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01172","headline":"相和歌辞 从军行三首 二 · 李约","name":"相和歌辞 从军行三首 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"栅高三面鬬，箭尽举烽频。\n营柳和烟暮，关榆带雪春。\n边城多老将，碛路少归人。\n点尽三河卒，年年添塞尘。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李约","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_01172.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01172","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}